          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yaagira ati: Eki nikyo MUKAMA arikubaragiira, naagira ati: Encuro ya homeri emwe ebiikwe ahabwa baijukuru baanyu ab'obusingye oburiija, nyentsya bareebe eby'okurya ebi naabaire mbariisiza omu ihamba, obu naabaiha omu nsi ya Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
