                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Musa yaagira Arooni ati: Twara orwabya, orutemu homeri y'emaanu, orubiikye omu maisho ga MUKAMA, emaanu egyo ebiikwe ahabwa baijukuru baanyu ab'obusingye oburiija. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
