        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi Abaisraeli bakamara emyaka makumi ana nibarya emaanu, okuhitsya obu baahikire omu nsi etwirwemu abantu; baagumizamu nibarya emaanu okuhitsya obu baahikire aha myatano y'ensi ya Kanaani. ",
          "type": "text",
